/2419730/extras/8a091d6b9b67b66aeda2f9fdddaf9867.mp4?t=1726999007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Balancing</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How are you with heights? You will have to get good and refine your balancing skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419730/extras/8406d8460c30fd1edb56883a6e6a3ca4.poster.avif?t=1726999007\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419730/extras/8406d8460c30fd1edb56883a6e6a3ca4.webm?t=1726999007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419730/extras/8406d8460c30fd1edb56883a6e6a3ca4.mp4?t=1726999007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Many Obsticles</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultimate Speed Run has many obsticles to have fun with. There is no random chance, you will have to decide where and when to make your moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419730/extras/f8f0a43dd13837c044a9103f56b2602d.poster.avif?t=1726999007\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419730/extras/f8f0a43dd13837c044a9103f56b2602d.webm?t=1726999007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419730/extras/f8f0a43dd13837c044a9103f56b2602d.mp4?t=1726999007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Leaderboards</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level has a Steam Leadboard associated with it. Compe