utoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419730/extras/39d0f1af309d115c01b50664b7bc9750.poster.avif?t=1726999007\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419730/extras/39d0f1af309d115c01b50664b7bc9750.webm?t=1726999007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419730/extras/39d0f1af309d115c01b50664b7bc9750.mp4?t=1726999007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "USR is a 3rd person platformer, that takes gaming back to the basics. The idea is simple... a single player, assault-course game. Easy to learn, hard to master. Where timing is everything, and nothing is down to 'chance'. Take the test... be the best, be the USR Champion!",
